---
import Layout from '@layouts/default.astro';
import { themeConfig } from '~/theme.config';

const title = 'Privacy Policy';
const description = `How ${themeConfig.name} handles data: no accounts, lesson progress stored on your device, and sponsor links that leave the site.`;
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} robots="noindex, follow">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy policy</h1>
  <div class="lesson-prose mt-6">
    <p>This site does not ask you to create an account. Lesson pages do not send your progress to a server.</p>
    <p>
      When you mark a lesson done, the browser stores that mark in localStorage on your device. Clearing site data removes it. We do not receive that list.
    </p>
    <p>
      Sponsor cards link away from the site, or to the advertise page. Those links include utm_medium=sponsor and utm_content set to the placement, so a sponsor can tell which slot was clicked. We do not add your name or email to those links.
    </p>
    <p>There is no newsletter and no comment form in this version. If that changes, this page will say what is collected and why.</p>
    <p>Pages are static files. A host such as Cloudflare may log requests the way any public website does. We do not sell personal information. We do not have an account database to sell.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
